      "prompt": "Replace the woman on the right (on the right of the frame), the person filled in red in <Video 2>, in <Video 1> with Cal, the person shown in <Picture 1>, <Picture 2>: A man in his late sixties with swept-back silver hair, in a charcoal wool overcoat, navy sweater, dark trousers and black shoes. Take the face only from the close portrait in <Picture 1>. <Picture 2> is a character sheet: body, build, hair from behind and clothing; the heads are left out of the full-body panels on purpose. Dress them in their reference outfit from <Picture 1>, <Picture 2>. Keep the replaced person's exact performance from <Video 1>: body movement, pose, gestures, facial expression, gaze, head turns, lip movement and timing. Keep every other person, the background, all objects, the framing, the lighting, the camera movement and the audio exactly as in <Video 1>. <Video 2> only marks who is replaced; no red fill appears in the result. Photorealistic, natural skin, same film look.",
